  "id": "BIT-discourse-2026-72730",
  "summary": "Discourse: Stored XSS chat-transcript username unescaped in Rich Text Editor",
  "details": "Discourse is an open-source discussion platform. Prior to 2026.1.6, 2026.5.2, 2026.6.1, and 2026.7.0, the Rich Text Editor rendered a chat-transcript username as HTML, allowing stored cross-site scripting. This issue is fixed in versions 2026.1.6, 2026.5.2, 2026.6.1, and 2026.7.0.",
